# One line ending in the repository, on every platform.
#
# The `check` gate begins with `dart format --set-exit-if-changed`, and the
# formatter keeps whatever ending a file already has. Without this, a Windows
# checkout under the default `core.autocrlf` is a working tree that differs
# from what CI formatted — the class of red that has nothing to do with the
# change being made.
* text=auto eol=lf
